From 7c00ede0c42d16a2ad194df1eb21461ae76f98bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 06:31:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1149/1157] fix(sessions): a free --source tag starts a
 tool-surface session again; a class: route defers to the agent [daveey]

hermes chat --oneshot --source bb-reviewer (and peer-mail, bb-judge) failed with invalid_params (source)
once the CLI created sessions through session.create: CanonicalCreateParams.source was a closed Literal and
build_policy refused anything outside SURFACES. A well-formed lowercase tag that is not a surface, platform
or routing label now runs as the tool surface and keeps its own stored label (sidebar_exclude_sources and
--source filters still name it).

--source tool on a class: model failed with 'Class routing requires a durable session/job identity':
route_runtime resolved the selector with no session id. It now defers class resolution to AIAgent
(prepare_agent_route), like the messaging path does.
